    "highlights": "Special text styles include inline links displaying on hover with an underline, and playful display usages of custom typefaces like 'franxurter', 'swingus', 'riddim', and 'riddimscript' for decorative product logotypes and playful graphic elements.",
    "insights": [
      "The typography system relies heavily on fluid viewport-based units (`calc(... * 100vw)`) combined with local scale variables, ensuring a rigid but highly responsive grid-locked typographic scale.",
      "A strict adherence to ultralight (100) and light (300) font weights establishes a highly technical, minimalist, and airy aesthetic typical of industrial design.",
      "Two primary proprietary sans-serif typefaces (`te-20` and `te-40`) carry the majority of the UI, differentiating largely by their intended scale, while a robust set of decorative fonts provides distinctive branding per product."
